  currentPath={`${base}/comparison/`}
>
  <h1>Comparison</h1>
  <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground !mt-2">
    Side-by-side comparison of all surveyed libraries across key dimensions.
  </p>

  <hr />

  <h2>Two-Axis Labels</h2>

  <p>Each library can be labeled along two independent axes: how it organizes state, and what its change notification carries.</p>

  <div class="not-prose my-6 w-full overflow-auto rounded-lg border border-border bg-card">
    <table class="w-full min-w-[760px] caption-bottom text-sm">
      <thead class="[&_tr]:border-b">
        <tr class="border-b transition-colors">
          <th class="h-10 px-4 text-left align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground">Quadrant</th>
          <th class="h-10 px-4 text-left align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground">Libraries</th>
          <th class="h-10 px-4 text-left align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground">Label</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="[&_tr:last-child]:border-0">
        <tr class="border-b transition-colors hover:bg-muted/50">
          <td class="p-4 align-middle font-medium text-foreground">Store + Value-push</td>
          <td class="p-4 align-middle text-muted-foreground">Verge, Zustand, StateFlow, BLoC / Cubit</td>
          <td class="p-4 align-middle text-muted-foreground">A feature store emits the new state, selected value, or stream value to listeners.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-b transition-colors hover:bg-muted/50">
          <td class="p-4 align-middle font-medium text-foreground">Store + Invalidation/read</td>
          <td class="p-4 align-middle text-muted-foreground">Redux, TCA with Observation, Provider / ChangeNotifier</td>
          <td class="p-4 align-middle text-muted-foreground">The store or object notifies that something changed; consumers read the current value.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-b transition-colors hover:bg-muted/50">
          <td class="p-4 align-middle font-medium text-foreground">Atomic + Value-push</td>
          <td class="p-4 align-middle text-muted-foreground">Riverpod, Atoms, ReactiveState-Kotlin</td>
          <td class="p-4 align-middle text-muted-foreground">Graph dependencies are tracked, and mounted watchers/listeners receive changed values.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="transition-colors hover:bg-muted/50">
          <td class="p-4 align-middle font-medium text-foreground">Atomic + Invalidation/read</td>
          <td class="p-4 align-middle text-muted-foreground">swift-state-graph, Compose <code>derivedStateOf</code>, Jotai core, TanStack Store derived values</td>
          <td class="p-4 align-middle text-muted-foreground">Changes invalidate or dirty the graph; derived values are read or recomputed when needed.</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

